  "name": "Question 4",
  "problem": "Using the normal approximation to the binomial distribution, approximate the probability of getting $30$ odd numbers on $70$ rolls of a $6$-sided die. Give your final answer to three decimal places.\n\n*Hint: The data below is taken from the table of values of the cumulative distribution function $Φ(z)$ for the standard normal distribution. *\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.3\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0968\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0951\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0934\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.2\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1151\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1131\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1112\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.1\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1357\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1335\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1314\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.0\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1587\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1562\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1539\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.07\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.08\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.09\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.3\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0854\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0838\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0823\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.2\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1020\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1003\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0985\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.1\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1210\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1190\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1170\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.0\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1423\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1401\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1379\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody></table>",
